& [Finding]
  + pre-repair implementation exported the exact terminal-outcome enum but no typed form enforced NHLP-018 occurrence and cleanup ambiguity
  + this left acceptance A02 only partially supported even though the future outcomes themselves were enumerated

& [CorrectionReview]
  + InnerLaunchTerminalAmbiguity makes outcome launch_may_have_occurred load_may_have_occurred and cleanup_success_asserted explicit supplied data
  + inner_launch_terminal_ambiguity is the single canonical constructor
  + validate_inner_launch_terminal_ambiguity rejects any record that differs from that outcome mapping
  + prelaunch_refused and launch_blocked alone map launch and load to false
  + launch_fault timed_out cancelled exit_success exit_failure and unknown_after_boundary map launch and load to true so absence is never invented after the boundary
  + cleanup_success_asserted is false for every outcome including exit_success

